        ],
        [
          "PEO2",
          "The graduates have professional skills and equipped with advanced technologies to become data scientists and data analysts."
        ],
        [
          "PEO3",
          "Graduates will have the ability to explore research and produce outstanding contribution in various areas of Artificial Intelligence and Data science."
